1. scrcpy — screen streaming and control protocol
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
scrcpy is Copyright (C) Genymobile and contributors and is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

    https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy
    https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy/releases/tag/v5.0.1

This repository redistributes, unmodified:

  * lib/vendor/scrcpy-server-v5.0.1.jar
        The official scrcpy v5.0.1 server JAR. At runtime the Host half pushes
        it to the Android guest as /data/local/tmp/scrcpy-server.jar and runs
        it through app_process to produce the H.264 stream and to exchange
        control messages. It is not modified, decompiled or re-signed by this
        project.
        SHA-256: 764EB6F79811D5211FE9DF341120882BA9994C7A61B897D7BF3FB662E53BC536
        Size: 733930 bytes

The H.264 demuxer and control-message implementation in lib/scrcpy.js were
written for this project against the scrcpy 5.0.1 protocol; no upstream scrcpy
client code is compiled or linked into the plugin. Upstream scrcpy sources and
test-only JAR copies are not part of this repository.

