4. Test fixtures
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
spike/android/sample.apk, spike/android/anim60.apk and the contents of
spike/android/miniapp/ are build artifacts generated for this project's tests
(signed debug APKs whose sources are in spike/android/miniapp/). They contain
no third-party application code.

The synthetic H.264 capture spike/scrcpy/capture-fake.h264 is generated by
spike/scrcpy/capture.js from the same fake-device harness. It contains no
third-party content.
